				<u>D.</u>
				4.133
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.385
			</span></i>: collectively in sg., <i>braided hair,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ τὰν πλοκαμῖδα φορεῦντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
